<NPR>Terms such as "sheet carpet" may be used in the industry for "broadloom carpet" 
and "textile composite flooring" may be used in the industry for "textile composite 
carpet."  Confirm differing terminologies when editing and selecting carpeting 
products.</NPR><BRK/>
